    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inuyo Academy, the best school on earth!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Inuyo Academy</strong> was once a thriving all-ages school, full of many wonderful students eager to learn. One day, something terrible happened after the mascot staff was introduced to the children. The students disappeared, and it\u2019s your job to figure out what really caused this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the abandoned halls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inuyo Academy has been left abandoned for years, and the staff has remained silent regarding the incident. As an officer, you must wander the halls of the abandoned school, searching for any evidence you can find leading to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re not alone\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something isn\u2019t right\u2026 you aren\u2019t alone. The school\u2019s mascot staff still remains inside the building, and you must make sure to stay safe from them. You are also given a taser tool to help you unlock doors and efficiently make your way through the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But above all\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the monsters. Find the evidence. <strong>Stay alive.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inuyo Academy, the best school on earth!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Inuyo Academy</strong> was once a thriving all-ages school, full of many wonderful students eager to learn. One day, something terrible happened after the mascot staff was introduced to the children. The students disappeared, and it\u2019s your job to figure out what really caused this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the abandoned halls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inuyo Academy has been left abandoned for years, and the staff has remained silent regarding the incident. As an officer, you must wander the halls of the abandoned school, searching for any evidence you can find leading to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re not alone\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something isn\u2019t right\u2026 you aren\u2019t alone. The school\u2019s mascot staff still remains inside the building, and you must make sure to stay safe from them. You are also given a taser tool to help you unlock doors and efficiently make your way through the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But above all\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the monsters. Find the evidence. <strong>Stay alive.</strong></p>",
